+    </message>
+    <message name="IDS_CROMIKO_SETTINGS_DNS_STATUS_AUTOMATIC" desc="Big status of CromIKO DNS when it uses the DNS of the network, encrypted when possible.">
+      Protected when possible
+    </message>
+    <message name="IDS_CROMIKO_SETTINGS_DNS_STATUS_AUTOMATIC_DETAIL" desc="Line under the status of CromIKO DNS in automatic mode, and the description of the Automatic card.">
+      Your network's DNS, encrypted when it supports it
+    </message>
+    <message name="IDS_CROMIKO_SETTINGS_DNS_STATUS_OFF" desc="Big status of CromIKO DNS when it is off.">
+      CromIKO DNS is off
